Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.75,0:29:19.45,Nachi,,0,0,0,,原来如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.69,0:29:21.28,Nachi,,0,0,0,,{\fs35}Methane hydrate\N{\fs50\bord5}是可燃冰
